      "content": "i've tried everything. i go to therapy, i try hobbies, i try to be present... nothing works. it's like there's no way to reach the person behind the glass. everything you're suggesting just feels like more noise. more things to do to try and fix something that feels fundamentally broken. i don't think \"rhythm\" or \"expression\" is going to bring the color back. sometimes i just wonder if the grayness is actually who i am now. like, if this is just the end of the story. if there's even any point in trying to find the color if it's never coming back.",
